div.p:
Choose one of the following subjects. Is the title definite and clear? If it is not, change it so that it will be. For example, Photography  (5) is not a definite title. No one could attempt to explain the entire subject of photography in a few minutes. A better title for a theme would be one of the following: How to Develop a Negative;
                  How to Intensify [or reduce] a Negative;
                  Our Camera Club;
                  The Photography Exhibit at the Art Museum;
                  Kinematography;
                  Flash Light Pictures without Smoke or Odor;
                  The Conditions Necessary for a Good Snap Shot Picture;
                  The Advantages of Using a Developing Machine;
                  How My Camera Helped Pay for My Vacation. Can you suggest still others?
